<title>USA: Emerson Electric stock split approved.</title>
<headline>Emerson Electric stock split approved.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emerson Electric Co said Tuesday its shareholders approved an increase in its authorized common stock, which will allow it to execute a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The split was first announced in November.  </p>
<p>Emerson said shareholders of record as of February 21 will receive one additional share of common stock for each share held.</p>
<p>The shares will be distributed March 10.</p>
<p>The number of shares outstanding was not immediately available.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
